{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます:)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかよん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩こりはんぱない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はんぱない、、\n平仮名だとなんかかわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、前回の記事に書いた\n自己紹介の\n「一年から来ました伊藤万理華です」は\nウケ狙いじゃないんだ。\nわかってくれ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか言ってから間違えてるのが解るの遅すぎた笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「...ん⁇(なんでみんな笑ってるんだ？)\n＿......あ\"っああぁぁ‼///////」"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラスのみんながツッコんでくれてから\nやっと理解できた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ボケが激しいな、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音漏れの写真、落書きしてるのわかったかなぁ^^⁇\n溶けた音符が耳から垂れてってるんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく見てみて:D"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"静岡ダービーでのスタジアムライブ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の中、初めてグラウンドでライブ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サポーターのみなさんも暖かく迎えてくださって...‼\n楽しく踊ることができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフタイムにグラウンド一周"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っ\n手を振ってくださって嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46を暖かく迎えてくださって\nありがとうございましたxD"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなお疲れさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はあったかかったのに\n今日はちょっと寒かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日服何枚くらい着ればちょうど良いかわからん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、風邪ひいてないですか⁇\n体調悪くならないように\n毎日早寝早起きしようぜっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校も余裕もって行くようにしよっと‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もお仕事頑張りまりかや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まゆげふさふさ\n左の黒目の方が若干大きい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴよぴよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くわっっっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/0734416/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}